@startuml Edit_Group_Info
title Activity Diagram - Edit Group Info

|Instructor|
start
:Select a group;
:Click "Edit Group";
:Input new group name\nand description;
:Click "Save";

|Web Application|
:Validate input data;
if (Valid?) then (no)
  :Display validation error;
  stop
endif

:Send updated group info\nto backend;

|Backend API|
:Validate request body;
:Call GroupManagementService.\nUpdateGroupInfoAsync(groupId, request);
:Check if group exists;
if (Group not found?) then (yes)
  :Return 404 Not Found;
  stop
endif

:Update group entity:\n- GroupName\n- Description\n- UpdatedAt;
:Save changes to database;

if (Update successful?) then (yes)
  :Return GroupResponseDto;
  :Send 200 OK response;
else (no)
  :Return error message;
  :Send 400 Bad Request;
  stop
endif

|Web Application|
if (Response successful?) then (yes)
  :Display success message;
  :Refresh group list;
else (no)
  :Display error message;
  stop
endif

|Instructor|
:View updated group info;
stop
@enduml

